{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ao9Z2hvofNxngcpx5UEXWV","type":"tool_result","content":"16:(B32 operation-performance, B31 common-domain-handoff, B33 bounded-graph-caches e B35\n17:optional-worktree-runtime, esta em três fatias medidas), com o runtime opt-in e standalone\n18-preservado. O que o roadmap não entrega (cota e afinidade de CPU, limites por comando,\n19-named pipe no Windows, roteamento dos checks para o runtime por padrão) está em specs\n20-rascunho próprias, fora deste roadmap. A revisão do roadmap é feita sobre o estado congelado deste commit (sem mudar a matriz de validação nem a política até o fechamento). A chave do memo residente passou a conter a configuração efetiva do Git (revisão do roadmap, achado F1).\n21-\n22-## Milestone: operation-performance\n23-- after: spec:pose-check-spawns-fewer-git-processes, spec:pose-attention-within-a-second\n--\n37:[ADR de domínio/runtime Proposed](../adr/2026-10-14-shared-domain-and-optional-worktree-runtime.md).\n38-Resolver interface/IPC/ownership/compatibilidade e budgets antes de start.\n39:B31/B33 não exigem B35; runtime consome ambos após seus demais pré-requisitos.\n40-\n41-## Milestone: common-domain-handoff\n42-- after: spec:pose-cli-mcp-operation-results, spec:pose-writer-coordination-and-atomic-publication, spec:pose-governance-read-view-generation, spec:pose-recoverable-closeout-plan, spec:pose-mcp-active-context, spec:pose-safe-validate-orchestration\n43-- target_start:\n44-- target_due:\n45-- specs: pose-common-domain-and-cli-mcp-handoff\n--\n63:## Milestone: optional-worktree-runtime\n64-- after: operation-performance, common-domain-handoff, bounded-graph-caches, spec:pose-git-and-dispatch-snapshot-integrity, spec:pose-cli-mcp-operation-results, spec:pose-writer-coordination-and-atomic-publication, spec:pose-index-generation-integrity, spec:pose-governance-read-view-generation, spec:pose-attention-within-a-second\n65-- target_start:\n66-- target_due:\n67: